    <div class="carousel-text__content-slider">
      <div class="carousel-text__content-inner">
                  <div class="carousel-text__content-slide">
                          <h3 class="carousel-text__title">
                                  Indoor Soccer
                              </h3>
            
            
                          <div class="carousel-text__body">
                Ready to kick up some fun? Join an intramural soccer team and go for the goal!
              </div>
                      </div>
                  <div class="carousel-text__content-slide">
                          <h3 class="carousel-text__title">
                                  Basketball
                              </h3>
            
            
                          <div class="carousel-text__body">
                Dribble, pass, and score some 'hoop'tastic memories on an intramural basketball team. Whether you're a seasoned baller or new to the game, come join the fun and let's make every basket count!
              </div>
                      </div>
                  <div class="carousel-text__content-slide">
                          <h3 class="carousel-text__title">
                                  Flag Football
                              </h3>
            
            
                          <div class="carousel-text__body">
                Huddle up for some gridiron excitement! Whether you're a seasoned quarterback or new to the game, get ready to 'pass,' 'catch,' and make some unforgettable plays in a friendly game of flag football.
              </div>
                      </div>
                  <div class="carousel-text__content-slide">
                          <h3 class="carousel-text__title">
                                  Volleyball
                              </h3>
            
            
                          <div class="carousel-text__body">
                Serve up a smashing good time with our intramural volleyball league! Join us on the court to spike your stress away and set the stage for friendly competition.
              </div>
                      </div>
                  <div class="carousel-text__content-slide">
                          <h3 class="carousel-text__title">
                                  Frisbee Golf
                              </h3>
            
            
                          <div class="carousel-text__body">
                Get ready to 'disc'over a new level of fun on an intramural frisbee golf team! Join us for a round of frisbee golf and let's tee off for a fantastic time on the greens. Whether you're a seasoned player or new to the game, let's make some 'hole'-in-one memories together!
              </div>
                      </div>
                  <div class="carousel-text__content-slide">
                          <h3 class="carousel-text__title">
                                  Ultimate Frisbee
                              </h3>
            
            
                          <div class="carousel-text__body">
                Experience the ultimate adrenaline rush! Gather a group of friends and join us for a game of ultimate frisbee. Whether you're a seasoned player or new to the throw, come be a part of the action and let's create some 'frisbee'tastic memories together!
              </div>
                      </div>
              </div>
      <div class="carousel-arrow"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

        </div>
            </div>
</div>
