              <div class="field__item">




  <div class="accordion paragraph">

    
      
      
      <div class="accordion__all">
        <button class="accordion__expand-all">Expand All</button>
        <button class="accordion__collapse-all js-disabled" aria-expanded="false"
                disabled>Collapse All</button>
      </div>

              <div class="accordion__items">
          
      <div class="field field--name-field-accordion-items field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items">
              <div class="field__item">


  <div class="accordion__item clearfix paragraph">

    
      <button class="accordion__toggle" aria-expanded="false">
        Program Classes
        <span class="accordion__icon"></span>
      </button>

      <div class="accordion__content wysiwyg__body">
        <p>Program classes are free for QCC students, staff, faculty and members! If you have any questions, please email <a href="mailto:athletics@qcc.mass.edu">athletics@qcc.mass.edu</a> for more details.</p><h2><strong>Yoga</strong></h2><div dir="ltr"><div data-automation-id="CanvasZone" data-theme-emphasis="0"><div data-automation-id="CanvasZone-SectionContainer"><div data-automation-id="CanvasSection"><div><div data-automation-id="CanvasControl"><div><div data-sp-feature-tag="Rich Text Editor" data-sp-feature-instance-id="be4e81b5-4814-4195-9e0d-c205eacc5778" dir="auto"><div data-automation-id="textBox"><p data-text-type="withSpacing"><strong>Location: B61A (SSMC room)</strong></p><p data-text-type="withSpacing">Classes are <strong>free</strong> &amp; all levels are welcome!</p><p data-text-type="withSpacing">&nbsp;Mats, blocks, rings and balls are provided.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div dir="ltr"><div data-automation-id="CanvasZone" data-theme-emphasis="0"><div data-automation-id="CanvasZone-SectionContainer"><div data-automation-id="CanvasSection"><div><div data-automation-id="CanvasControl"><div><div data-sp-feature-tag="Rich Text Editor" data-sp-feature-instance-id="3eef4825-77df-4ddc-a80c-7067f7dfcdd5" dir="auto"><div data-automation-id="textBox"><div><h3>Yoga</h3></div><p data-text-type="withSpacing">Instructor: Paula Sheehan</p><p data-text-type="withSpacing"><strong>Mondays:</strong> 12:15-1:00 p.m.</p><hr><div><h3>PIYO Yoga</h3></div><p data-text-type="withSpacing"><em>A combination of Pilates, Yoga, and Conditioning geared towards all fitness levels.</em></p><p data-text-type="withSpacing">Instructor: Paula Sheehan</p><p data-text-type="withSpacing"><strong>Tuesdays:</strong> 12:00-12:45 p.m.</p><div><hr></div><div><h3>Yoga</h3></div><p data-text-type="withSpacing">Instructor: Tamara Chiarizio</p><p data-text-type="withSpacing"><strong>Wednesdays:</strong> 12:00-1:00 p.m.</p><p data-text-type="withSpacing"><strong>Fridays: </strong>12:00-1:00 p.m.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
        <button class="accordion__top">Back to Top</button>
      </div>

    
  </div>

</div>
              <div class="field__item">


  <div class="accordion__item clearfix paragraph">

    
      <button class="accordion__toggle" aria-expanded="false">
        Athletic Forms &amp; Documents
        <span class="accordion__icon"></span>
      </button>

      <div class="accordion__content wysiwyg__body">
        <p>A physical is required to participate in intercollegiate athletics. If you are interested in trying out for and joining any of the teams above, please print out this <a href="/sites/default/files/2023-11/physical_form.pdf">Physical Form</a> which is to be filled out by your physician. You must be enrolled in 12 credits during the season.</p><p>Here are other important forms you’ll need to participate in our College’s intercollegiate athletics:&nbsp;</p><ul><li data-list-item-id="eec249f4aecdbbb523a679ad66c31a18c"><a href="/sites/default/files/2023-11/holdharmless.pdf">Hold Harmless Agreement</a></li><li data-list-item-id="ead58668bee64c9b0476c1d94a5614fdb"><a href="/sites/default/files/2023-11/tryout_waiver_and_risk_release_form.pdf">Try Out Waiver/ Risk Release Form</a></li></ul><h3>Equity in Athletics</h3><p><a href="/sites/default/files/2026-10/equity_in_athletics.pdf">Equity in Athletics Statement</a></p>
        <button class="accordion__top">Back to Top</button>
      </div>

    
  </div>

</div>
          </div>
  
        </div>
      
    
  </div>

</div>
              <div class="field__item">



  <div class="wysiwyg paragraph">
    
              <div class="wysiwyg__body">
          <h2>Athletic Interest form</h2>
<p>Please fill out the form below if you are interested in playing a sport at our College.</p>
        </div>
      
      </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item">  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--webform paragraph--view-mode--default">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-embed-webform field--type-webform field--label-hidden field__item"><form class="webform-submission-form webform-submission-add-form webform-submission-athletic-interest-form-form webform-submission-athletic-interest-form-add-form webform-submission-athletic-interest-form-paragraph-1462-form webform-submission-athletic-interest-form-paragraph-1462-add-form js-webform-details-toggle webform-details-toggle" data-drupal-selector="webform-submission-athletic-interest-form-paragraph-1462-add-form" action="/student-experience/athletics" method="post" id="webform-submission-athletic-interest-form-paragraph-1462-add-form" accept-charset="UTF-8">
  
  <div id="edit-intro" class="js-webform-type-processed-text webform-type-processed-text js-form-item form-item js-form-type-processed-text form-type-processed-text js-form-item- form-item- form-no-label">
        <P><b>Eligibility Requirements Per The NJCAA</b></p>
<p>In order to participate in varsity athletics, all student-athletes must: </p>
<ul>
<li>Be enrolled as a full-time student, taking at least 12 credits during the semester of their sport.</li>
<li>Have a valid physical that clears the student athlete to compete in competitive sports. Physicals are valid for 12 months. </li>
</ul>
<p>Returning Students Must:</p>
<ul>
<li>Have a minimum 2.0 GPA and passed 12 credits during the previous semester of full-time enrollment.</li>
<li>Have a minimum 2.0 GPA and passed an average of 12 credits for every semester enrolled as a full-time student</li>
</ul>
        </div>
<fieldset data-drupal-selector="edit-name" id="edit-name--wrapper" class="webform-name--wrapper fieldgroup form-composite webform-composite-hidden-title js-webform-type-webform-name webform-type-webform-name js-form-item form-item js-form-wrapper form-wrapper">
      <legend>
    <span class="visually-hidden fieldset-legend">Name</span>
  </legend>
  <div class="fieldset-wrapper">
                <div class="webform-name">
  <div class="webform-flexbox">
              <div class="webform-flex webform-flex--3 webform-name__first"><div class="webform-flex--container"><div class="js-webform-type-textfield webform-type-textfield js-form-item form-item js-form-type-textfield form-type-textfield js-form-item-name-first form-item-name-first">
      <label for="edit-name-first" class="js-form-required form-required">First</label>
        <input data-drupal-selector="edit-name-first" type="text" id="edit-name-first" name="name[first]" value="" size="60" maxlength="255" class="form-text required" required="required" />

